DG2: fix F-DG2-206 — qa acceptance stack sets evidence storage env

e2e/support/qa-stack.sh now exports EVIDENCE_STORAGE_DRIVER=filesystem and
EVIDENCE_STORAGE_PATH=$WORK/evidence (mirrors apps/web/e2e/support/with-stack.sh),
so P2 evidence uploads no longer 503 and the serial P2 acceptance journey no
longer skips 8 tests per locale. Orchestrator-authored (qa raised F-206, so qa
verifies rather than self-authors) — qa confirms in its round-2 re-review.

